sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Controller
  participant W as Worker
  participant H as Gated helper
  C->>W: Request token, target, epoch, deadline
  W-->>C: Creation intent
  W->>H: Fork behind exec gate
  W-->>C: Register PID, parent, PGID, request token
  alt Epoch open and before deadline
    C->>C: Record helper ownership in memory
    C->>W: ACK exact token
    W->>H: Release gate
    H->>H: Check expiry, close unrelated descriptors, exec ps
    H-->>W: Bounded bytes and exit
    W-->>C: Terminal result and helper reap evidence
  else Missing registration, expiry or invalid identity
    C->>C: Sticky failure, known helper or unknown creation
    C->>W: Retire worker, signal only pinned worker group
    C->>C: Continue workload safety and resource teardown
    Note over W,H: Late creation cannot get a new ACK, residual audit remains required
  end
